    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλεταίρ-ιον</span></b> , τό, or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλεταίρ-ιος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμώνιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.8
			</span></i> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλεταιρίς</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.99
			</span></i>; but 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάμνος</span>
			, a spinous buckthorn, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				632
			</span></i>, where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλέταιριν</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκιμοειδές</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληματίς</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.7
			</span></i>.</div>
